{"type":"message","id":"adaa01e5","parentId":"e9447cf0","timestamp":"2026-03-10T15:17:14.014Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"目前技能分布在两个位置：\n\n**1. 系统内置技能（npm 安装目录）**\n```\n/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/\n```\n这里有 54 个内置技能，包括：\n- `clawhub` - 技能管理\n- `github` - GitHub 操作\n- `weather` - 天气查询\n- `obsidian` - 笔记管理\n- `apple-notes`, `apple-reminders` - 苹果原生应用\n- `gemini` - AI 问答\n- `mcporter` - MCP 服务器管理\n- 等等...\n\n**2. 用户安装技能（工作区目录）**\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/\n```\n这个目录目前为空。当你用 `clawhub install` 安装新技能时，默认会装到这里。\n\n如果你想改变安装位置，可以设置环境变量：\n```bash\nexport CLAWHUB_WORKDIR=/path/to/skills\n```\n\n需要我帮你安装什么技能吗？或者查看某个内置技能的详细用法？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773155821967}}
