Self Improving Agent V2  (3.205)\nself-improvement  Self Improving Agent  (2.094)\nself-evolve  Self-Evolve  (1.122)\nself-reflection  Self Reflection  (1.091)\nrecursive-self-improvement  Recursive Self Improvement  (1.040)\nreflection  Self Reflection  (0.986)\nself-evolution  Self Evolution  (0.946)\nself  Self  (0.942)\nneuroboost-elixir  Neuroboost Elixir  (0.866)\nself-evolve-agent  Self Evolve  (0.859)","cwd":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773156431340}}
