{"type":"message","id":"4eafae2b","parentId":"e246acfd","timestamp":"2026-03-10T15:34:43.711Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit:33","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md","old_string":"## 条目\n","new_string":"## 条目\n\n## [LRN-20250310-001] security_policy\n\n**Logged**: 2025-03-10T16:33:00+01:00\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: active\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n建立技能安装安全审查流程：所有技能安装前必须使用 Skill Vetter 审查，根据风险等级决定是否需要用户确认。\n\n### Details\n用户明确要求建立安全审查规则：\n- 安装任何技能前必须用 Skill Vetter 检查\n- 🟢 低风险：可直接安装\n- 🟡 中风险：可直接安装\n- 🔴 高风险：必须等待用户确认\n- ⛔ 极高风险：必须等待用户确认两次\n\n这是为了防止安装恶意或高风险技能，保护系统安全。\n\n### Suggested Action\n1. 每次用户要求安装技能时，先执行 Skill Vetter 审查\n2. 生成完整的风险评估报告\n3. 根据风险等级执行相应的确认流程\n4. 将这条规则记录到 AGENTS.md 作为长期行为准则\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: user_feedback\n- Related Files: AGENTS.md, TOOLS.md\n- Tags: security, skill-installation, workflow\n- Pattern-Key: security.skill-vetting\n\n---\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773156861007}}
