{"type":"message","id":"83af97e4","parentId":"05de99d4","timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:02:50.902Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ClawHub 上没有找到作者 JimLiuxinghai 的 Find Skills 技能。\n\n可能的情况：\n1. **作者名不同** - 可能用户名不是 JimLiuxinghai\n2. **技能名不同** - 可能不叫 \"Find Skills\"\n3. **技能未发布** - 可能还在开发中或未上传到 ClawHub\n4. **在 GitHub 上** - 可能需要在 GitHub 上直接安装\n\n你能提供更多线索吗？比如：\n- 你在哪里看到这个技能的（GitHub 链接、文章等）？\n- 技能的完整名称或描述？\n- 或者你可以直接提供 GitHub 仓库地址？\n\n这样我可以帮你找到并审查正确的技能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773158534343}}
