{"type":"message","id":"a0f728c5","parentId":"001b4354","timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:06:20.335Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:64","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Learnings Log\n\n记录学习心得、知识更新和最佳实践。\n\n## 格式模板\n\n```markdown\n## [LRN-YYYYMMDD-XXX] category\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 timestamp\n**Priority**: low | medium | high | critical\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: frontend | backend | infra | tests | docs | config\n\n### Summary\n一句话描述学到了什么\n\n### Details\n详细上下文：发生了什么，之前哪里错了，正确的做法是什么\n\n### Suggested Action\n具体的改进建议\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: conversation | error | user_feedback\n- Related Files: path/to/file.ext\n- Tags: tag1, tag2\n- See Also: LRN-20250110-001 (关联条目)\n- Pattern-Key: (可选，用于追踪重复模式)\n\n---\n```\n\n## 条目\n\n## [LRN-20250310-001] security_policy\n\n**Logged**: 2025-03-10T16:33:00+01:00\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: promoted\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n建立技能安装安全审查流程：所有技能安装前必须使用 Skill Vetter 审查，根据风险等级决定是否需要用户确认。\n\n### Details\n用户明确要求建立安全审查规则：\n- 安装任何技能前必须用 Skill Vetter 检查\n- 🟢 低风险：可直接安装\n- 🟡 中风险：可直接安装\n- 🔴 高风险：必须等待用户确认\n- ⛔ 极高风险：必须等待用户确认两次\n\n这是为了防止安装恶意或高风险技能，保护系统安全。\n\n### Suggested Action\n1. 每次用户要求安装技能时，先执行 Skill Vetter 审查\n2. 生成完整的风险评估报告\n3. 根据风险等级执行相应的确认流程\n4. 将这条规则记录到 AGENTS.md 作为长期行为准则\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: user_feedback\n- Related Files: AGENTS.md, TOOLS.md\n- Tags: security, skill-installation, workflow\n- Pattern-Key: security.skill-vetting\n\n---\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773158780327}}
{"type":"message","id":"3cbadb49","parentId":"a0f728c5","timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:06:40.641Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit:65","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md","old_string":"---\n","new_string":"---\n\n## [LRN-20250310-002] workflow_optimization\n\n**Logged**: 2025-03-10T17:06:00+01:00\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: active\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n优化网络搜索工作流：Tavily 搜索 + Summarize 总结，总结内容必须控制在 500 字以内。\n\n### Details\n用户明确要求网络搜索的工作流程：\n1. 使用 Tavily Search 搜索相关网页\n2. 使用 Summarize 对关键网页进行深度总结\n3. 总结内容控制在 500 字以内，保持简洁\n\n这样可以兼顾搜索的全面性和回答的精炼性。\n\n### Suggested Action\n1. 执行 Tavily 搜索获取相关结果\n2. 对重要网页使用 Summarize 提取核心内容\n3. 整合输出时严格控制字数在 500 字以内\n4. 如需更多细节，可询问用户是否需要展开\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: user_feedback\n- Related Files: TOOLS.md\n- Tags: workflow, search, tavily, summarize\n- Pattern-Key: workflow.web-search\n- See Also: LRN-20250310-001\n\n---\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773158780331}}
